 "notes": "Packet F5 carries the paper Fig. 6 caption and image; paper Fig. 5 is absent from the packet. F1 caption is truncated before panels F-H, but crops F1f-h exist with caption spans. F3 caption gives current density as \"11 mA h g-1\" (should be mA g-1). F1g crop joins FTIR and TGA; TGA node cites whole F1. F1d: w/ HCl pattern is not visibly sharper than w/o HCl (o4 audit). F3d: Fe edge stays near the Fe3+ line (o19 audit). F5c raw Nyquist does not show Rct growth (o21 audit). Lost: Figs S1-S6 (ball milling, HRTEM of simple mixing, retention, dQ/dV, magnified Nyquist, circuit comparison). Branches: crystallinity -> utilization, V+Fe multi-redox -> capacity (joint), cycling -> V dissolution -> Rct -> fade; alternative structural degradation ruled out.",
